(1011680, 121243, 22970, '<td valign="top">Now I really like this photograph, it has emotion. You can see it in his eyes and face. The Washington Monument in the background is great being out of focus just enough to add to the picture but not over power the subject. One note: This shot has so much emotion I believe if you could see a video of this same man at the same time you took the picture he would be as motionless and concentrated as in this photograph captures and when you can achieve what would happen after this fraction of time you have captured in a photo, you have done an excellent job.</td>', 'Now I really like this photograph, it has emotion. You can see it in his eyes and face. The Washington Monument in the background is great being out of focus just enough to add to the picture but not over power the subject. One note: This shot has so much emotion I believe if you could see a video of this same man at the same time you took the picture he would be as motionless and concentrated as in this photograph captures and when you can achieve what would happen after this fraction of time you have captured in a photo, you have done an excellent job.', '2004-11-15 10:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011694, 121276, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, very intense eyes and great lighting.  Only thing I don´t like is your crop, I would have it tighter and lose that space on the left and top but this is a strong image.</td>', 'Great portrait, very intense eyes and great lighting.  Only thing I don´t like is your crop, I would have it tighter and lose that space on the left and top but this is a strong image.', '2004-11-15 10:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011696, 120676, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but IMO I dont like the desaturation it pulls my attention to the red when I believe the mans expression says more in this photograph..</td>', 'Nice photo but IMO I dont like the desaturation it pulls my attention to the red when I believe the mans expression says more in this photograph..', '2004-11-15 10:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011735, 121210, 22970, '<td valign="top">I dont believe the desaturation helps in this photo. I believe it takes my eye away from the hero and focusing it on the flowers. I wish your photograph would of told whom you hero was it keeps me guessing. The cross seems new [maybe you a trying to portray a new resting place] but I believe it would have been better worn by the weather [old wood]. But I will have to say your lighting and angle were good.</td>', 'I dont believe the desaturation helps in this photo. I believe it takes my eye away from the hero and focusing it on the flowers. I wish your photograph would of told whom you hero was it keeps me guessing. The cross seems new [maybe you a trying to portray a new resting place] but I believe it would have been better worn by the weather [old wood]. But I will have to say your lighting and angle were good.', '2004-11-15 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011771, 121424, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and I like the shadows and the use of B&amp;W. I also love your subject. Top circle a little burned out but overall a great job.</td>', 'Good lighting and I like the shadows and the use of B&W. I also love your subject. Top circle a little burned out but overall a great job.', '2004-11-15 11:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
