(1011815, 120907, 24715, '<td valign="top">Very cool armor. Good lighting and focus. But I would recommend using different pose so the head would be visible. Not sure where you''re located but more medieval background would be really nice.</td>', 'Very cool armor. Good lighting and focus. But I would recommend using different pose so the head would be visible. Not sure where you''re located but more medieval background would be really nice.', '2004-11-15 11:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011823, 121276, 22970, '<td valign="top">In my judgment this is immense shot with brilliant lighting and shadows and black and white works great with this photograph. You leave me wondering where the hero theme is sited in the photo but the photograph it self is telling me its there. I dont know why, my best guess is you prepared such a good photograph that my interpretation is overridden by the power of the photo. 10</td>', 'In my judgment this is immense shot with brilliant lighting and shadows and black and white works great with this photograph. You leave me wondering where the hero theme is sited in the photo but the photograph it self is telling me its there. I dont know why, my best guess is you prepared such a good photograph that my interpretation is overridden by the power of the photo. 10', '2004-11-15 11:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011840, 121416, 22970, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful photograph full of emotion. It meets the challenge with no doubt. I think titles can add to a photo as well as take away, your title ADDED to the photo. As far as the picture I think your lighting is good with good use shadows. Focus right on and the use of B&amp;W works well  wow you can feel the emotion. Great job 10.</td>', 'This is a very powerful photograph full of emotion. It meets the challenge with no doubt. I think titles can add to a photo as well as take away, your title ADDED to the photo. As far as the picture I think your lighting is good with good use shadows. Focus right on and the use of B&W works well  wow you can feel the emotion. Great job 10.', '2004-11-15 11:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011854, 121030, 20210, '<td valign="top">This is exactly like a shot from the school days challenge.  Same shooter, I wonder?  It''s a good technical shot, but doesn''t really fit the theme for my taste.  Maybe a bus-driver is a hero, but just a bus?  And having it be the reflection instead of the bus doesn''t add to the meaning in this case.</td>', 'This is exactly like a shot from the school days challenge.  Same shooter, I wonder?  It''s a good technical shot, but doesn''t really fit the theme for my taste.  Maybe a bus-driver is a hero, but just a bus?  And having it be the reflection instead of the bus doesn''t add to the meaning in this case.', '2004-11-15 12:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1011855, 120575, 19978, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done. My eyes were naturally drawn to the principle subjects (eyes and lips) as well as the red band of the hat. The more I look at this photo, the more it appeals to me.</td>', 'Extremely well done. My eyes were naturally drawn to the principle subjects (eyes and lips) as well as the red band of the hat. The more I look at this photo, the more it appeals to me.', '2004-11-15 12:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
