(1012214, 119712, 27293, '<td valign="top">mr hefner is a hero? i read playboy on a regular basis, and there is nothing wrong with that, but i don''t think he''s a hero, more of a successful marketing guy or an etrepreneur or something.</td>', 'mr hefner is a hero? i read playboy on a regular basis, and there is nothing wrong with that, but i don''t think he''s a hero, more of a successful marketing guy or an etrepreneur or something.', '2004-11-15 16:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012221, 121252, 27293, '<td valign="top">The part in focus should be less in the middle of the picture. Too symmetrical as it is. Pretty good idea though, and a very clever choice of B/w.</td>', 'The part in focus should be less in the middle of the picture. Too symmetrical as it is. Pretty good idea though, and a very clever choice of B/w.', '2004-11-15 16:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012227, 120676, 27293, '<td valign="top">I''d rather see this just in b/w. Selective desat makes it too cheesy and populistic. This is not one of those glamour shots. Otherwise a very good image, perhaps a tad more contrast would be in order.</td>', 'I''d rather see this just in b/w. Selective desat makes it too cheesy and populistic. This is not one of those glamour shots. Otherwise a very good image, perhaps a tad more contrast would be in order.', '2004-11-15 16:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012235, 121336, 25371, '<td valign="top">Reminds me more of Napoleon than of Mozart.</td>', 'Reminds me more of Napoleon than of Mozart.', '2004-11-15 17:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012248, 120907, 25371, '<td valign="top">I am certainly not the first who complains the cropped foots. Also the knight has no head (at least it is hidden behind the hands). You should definitly make further shots with that incredible silver armor.</td>', 'I am certainly not the first who complains the cropped foots. Also the knight has no head (at least it is hidden behind the hands). You should definitly make further shots with that incredible silver armor.', '2004-11-15 17:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012255, 120656, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections in the water.  Photographing the structure at night gives it a more mythic quality - good for the challenge.  I do not feel the large amount of sky does anything for the picture, I would have prefered more water relfections if possible.  Perhaps focusing your attention on the end of the building with the olympic sign would have created a composition that filled the frame more and foucused the subject.</td>', 'I like the reflections in the water.  Photographing the structure at night gives it a more mythic quality - good for the challenge.  I do not feel the large amount of sky does anything for the picture, I would have prefered more water relfections if possible.  Perhaps focusing your attention on the end of the building with the olympic sign would have created a composition that filled the frame more and foucused the subject.', '2004-11-15 17:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012261, 121241, 7628, '<td valign="top">The burst of sun is very appropriate here.  I wish it came from behind the cross, and you could have cropped out the ditracting white building.  I like the cross in silouette, but I wish I could see more of Jesus - perhaps from a vantage point more to the right you could have captured more of him and had the sun coming from behind the cross?</td>', 'The burst of sun is very appropriate here.  I wish it came from behind the cross, and you could have cropped out the ditracting white building.  I like the cross in silouette, but I wish I could see more of Jesus - perhaps from a vantage point more to the right you could have captured more of him and had the sun coming from behind the cross?', '2004-11-15 17:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012264, 121252, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great use of depth of focus, and perfect subject matter.  The repetition of last and first names if a bit puzzling - perhaps it would have been better to have 4 completely different names,</td>', 'Great use of depth of focus, and perfect subject matter.  The repetition of last and first names if a bit puzzling - perhaps it would have been better to have 4 completely different names,', '2004-11-15 17:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012275, 120833, 7628, '<td valign="top">Good job being in the right place at the right time,  I like the way the bright red of the helecopter frames the people - and having them off to the right side of the frame implies their need to move quickly.  Positioning the composition this way you''ve minimalized the distraction of the onlookers,the building, and trees - our eyed go right to the helecopter and down the the streatcher.  I wish I could see the epressions on the faces of the "heros" better - but that is just the limitation of the subject.</td>', 'Good job being in the right place at the right time,  I like the way the bright red of the helecopter frames the people - and having them off to the right side of the frame implies their need to move quickly.  Positioning the composition this way you''ve minimalized the distraction of the onlookers,the building, and trees - our eyed go right to the helecopter and down the the streatcher.  I wish I could see the epressions on the faces of the "heros" better - but that is just the limitation of the subject.', '2004-11-15 17:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012279, 121279, 15574, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, cool poses and nice background. But the title is a real bummer.</td>', 'I like this picture, cool poses and nice background. But the title is a real bummer.', '2004-11-15 17:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012280, 121420, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the angle looking up, and how the Buddha fills the frame.  NIce range of tones.  Wish it were more in focus - Could a greater depth of focus gotten it all sharp?</td>', 'I like the angle looking up, and how the Buddha fills the frame.  NIce range of tones.  Wish it were more in focus - Could a greater depth of focus gotten it all sharp?', '2004-11-15 17:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012286, 121208, 7628, '<td valign="top">Having the bright stone on the thirds line is a good choice for composition.  I like the diagonal line of the stones.  It needs more interest somehow - would be nice if the leaves at the top came more into the frame.  It feels very rough, grainy, which works with the subject.  But at the same time the scattered stones and the scattered texture make it feel to loose for me.  Perhaps getting in a bit closer to the white stone, and using a smaller depth of focus so the one stone is sharp while the other blur into the distance.  This would anchor the composition more.</td>', 'Having the bright stone on the thirds line is a good choice for composition.  I like the diagonal line of the stones.  It needs more interest somehow - would be nice if the leaves at the top came more into the frame.  It feels very rough, grainy, which works with the subject.  But at the same time the scattered stones and the scattered texture make it feel to loose for me.  Perhaps getting in a bit closer to the white stone, and using a smaller depth of focus so the one stone is sharp while the other blur into the distance.  This would anchor the composition more.', '2004-11-15 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012292, 119919, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice lighting. Well done getting Mr. I to stand out so well against a red background.  The tiny bit of reflection at the bottom feels odd - perhaps more would be more natural?  While well done, not extremely original.</td>', 'nice lighting. Well done getting Mr. I to stand out so well against a red background.  The tiny bit of reflection at the bottom feels odd - perhaps more would be more natural?  While well done, not extremely original.', '2004-11-15 17:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012300, 121276, 7628, '<td valign="top">Have I seen this extraordinary-looking man somewhere before?  His expression does speak more than words.  The lighting and the composition serve to enhance that.  Crisp, beautiful, somehow both dramatic and understated.  Although he does not fill the frame - he does!  He projects a force of personality around him - and your narrow DOF helps the viewer to visualize that. My favorite so far. 10</td>', 'Have I seen this extraordinary-looking man somewhere before?  His expression does speak more than words.  The lighting and the composition serve to enhance that.  Crisp, beautiful, somehow both dramatic and understated.  Although he does not fill the frame - he does!  He projects a force of personality around him - and your narrow DOF helps the viewer to visualize that. My favorite so far. 10', '2004-11-15 17:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012303, 120833, 6630, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Hmm</td>', 'Very nice!  Hmm', '2004-11-15 17:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012304, 121288, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think the concept is good, but the compostion is a little boring.  I think I might have tried a closer shot, maybe from an angle, to add some depth.  It looks like you tried to keep the flag in the shot, but in this case, to do so creates a lot of negative blank space.  One other thing,  you probably should have used a tripod for this night shot as it''s a little blurred.  Good luck</td>', 'I think the concept is good, but the compostion is a little boring.  I think I might have tried a closer shot, maybe from an angle, to add some depth.  It looks like you tried to keep the flag in the shot, but in this case, to do so creates a lot of negative blank space.  One other thing,  you probably should have used a tripod for this night shot as it''s a little blurred.  Good luck', '2004-11-15 17:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012306, 120641, 18799, '<td valign="top">Really cool effect.  This is the only "toy" to make it to a high score for me.  I''ll be interested to see how you did this when the challenge is over.  9</td>', 'Really cool effect.  This is the only "toy" to make it to a high score for me.  I''ll be interested to see how you did this when the challenge is over.  9', '2004-11-15 17:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012310, 120030, 7628, '<td valign="top">Bright and dramatic.  I like the proportion of land. sky and sculpture.  Seems to find the right balance.  Must have looked fabulous a week or two ago when the line of the horizen was red/orange/yellow with fall foliage.  The bareness seems to create a more heroic mood.  I really enjoy this. 8</td>', 'Bright and dramatic.  I like the proportion of land. sky and sculpture.  Seems to find the right balance.  Must have looked fabulous a week or two ago when the line of the horizen was red/orange/yellow with fall foliage.  The bareness seems to create a more heroic mood.  I really enjoy this. 8', '2004-11-15 17:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012312, 121385, 18799, '<td valign="top">Voted before, but returning for comments and a slight bump.  I really like the lighting, it''s very dramatic and works here (although it appears a little uneven from burning).  I like that you used someone who is challenged as a hero model (at least moreso than some of the toys and dogs in other submissions).  One nit is that the skin, particularly on the face, looks kind of overprocessed (NI maybe).   Still, 9 from me.</td>', 'Voted before, but returning for comments and a slight bump.  I really like the lighting, it''s very dramatic and works here (although it appears a little uneven from burning).  I like that you used someone who is challenged as a hero model (at least moreso than some of the toys and dogs in other submissions).  One nit is that the skin, particularly on the face, looks kind of overprocessed (NI maybe).   Still, 9 from me.', '2004-11-15 17:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012314, 121333, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle - more original approach than straight-on, but I''m not sure it show off Buzz''s heroic qualities very well.  If I didn''t know what the character looks like I''d be a bit confused by the proportions.  Also the strange rock-like thing is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Interesting angle - more original approach than straight-on, but I''m not sure it show off Buzz''s heroic qualities very well.  If I didn''t know what the character looks like I''d be a bit confused by the proportions.  Also the strange rock-like thing is a bit distracting.', '2004-11-15 17:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012315, 121243, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good job of exposing and composing. Only nit is that the monument is at an angle.  8</td>', 'Good job of exposing and composing. Only nit is that the monument is at an angle.  8', '2004-11-15 17:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012317, 120710, 7628, '<td valign="top">Sometimes small heros are the best.  I like the light colored fur against the light background - the spiky collar really pops out and says, "I''m may look cute, but I''m tough were it counts."  Lighting this a bit more dramatically - bright on one side and dark on another, might have differentiated the dog from the background a bit more.  Also could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Sometimes small heros are the best.  I like the light colored fur against the light background - the spiky collar really pops out and says, "I''m may look cute, but I''m tough were it counts."  Lighting this a bit more dramatically - bright on one side and dark on another, might have differentiated the dog from the background a bit more.  Also could be a bit sharper.', '2004-11-15 17:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012321, 121379, 7628, '<td valign="top">Dramatic subject - I particularly like the rusted and broken fence, which speaks to your title nicely.  I think the use of a narrower depth of focus would help the background recede and help the voewer concentrate on the subject.  The trees just make this too busy.</td>', 'Dramatic subject - I particularly like the rusted and broken fence, which speaks to your title nicely.  I think the use of a narrower depth of focus would help the background recede and help the voewer concentrate on the subject.  The trees just make this too busy.', '2004-11-15 17:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012324, 120709, 7628, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait.  I like the black and white, help to bring attention to his nice face.  I wish it were sharper and I wish his expression revealed more about him.</td>', 'A nice portrait.  I like the black and white, help to bring attention to his nice face.  I wish it were sharper and I wish his expression revealed more about him.', '2004-11-15 17:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012326, 120657, 7628, '<td valign="top">A vivid expression on this young man''s face, that and the bright yellow and red make this very compelling.  I wish the background were blurred either using depth of focus or by selectively blurring in photoshop.  His face could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'A vivid expression on this young man''s face, that and the bright yellow and red make this very compelling.  I wish the background were blurred either using depth of focus or by selectively blurring in photoshop.  His face could be a bit sharper.', '2004-11-15 17:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012335, 121416, 7628, '<td valign="top">beautiful - the reflection gives the illusion of hands in prayer.  I like the other hands too - the viewer can see the connections between the living and the connections with those gone. Wish it were just a bit sharper. 9</td>', 'beautiful - the reflection gives the illusion of hands in prayer.  I like the other hands too - the viewer can see the connections between the living and the connections with those gone. Wish it were just a bit sharper. 9', '2004-11-15 18:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012341, 121336, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative and obviously a lot of work!  Mimics in 3-D the poster in 2-D.</td>', 'Very imaginative and obviously a lot of work!  Mimics in 3-D the poster in 2-D.', '2004-11-15 18:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012344, 120899, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of movement you get from the blurring on the edges.  Light is a bit bright off the helmet.  Very dramatic.</td>', 'I like the sense of movement you get from the blurring on the edges.  Light is a bit bright off the helmet.  Very dramatic.', '2004-11-15 18:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012349, 120658, 7628, '<td valign="top">great subject.  I like your focus on the hands and the food.  The image is a bit busy - I would like to see a shot that came in closer and at an angle that avoind the jumble in th background.  More even lighting would be better too - too bright and harsh on the right , while dark and lacking contrast on the left.</td>', 'great subject.  I like your focus on the hands and the food.  The image is a bit busy - I would like to see a shot that came in closer and at an angle that avoind the jumble in th background.  More even lighting would be better too - too bright and harsh on the right , while dark and lacking contrast on the left.', '2004-11-15 18:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012351, 121050, 7628, '<td valign="top">Dramatic composition.  I wish the water had more details - exposed darker, or burned in afterward.</td>', 'Dramatic composition.  I wish the water had more details - exposed darker, or burned in afterward.', '2004-11-15 18:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012355, 121279, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nicely set up with the natural and blurred background.  The lighting could be better - wish the figures were lighter and the background darker. Wish the dark branches in the background were further away/smaller.  As is they serve as a reminder of how small the figures are.</td>', 'Nicely set up with the natural and blurred background.  The lighting could be better - wish the figures were lighter and the background darker. Wish the dark branches in the background were further away/smaller.  As is they serve as a reminder of how small the figures are.', '2004-11-15 18:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012360, 121215, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like all the colors.  There is no point of focus in this very busy image.  The resolution also doesn''t seem great.  I like the sea of veterans - it just needs a anchor point, or a point of reference - an oject, a place, a person  -</td>', 'I like all the colors.  There is no point of focus in this very busy image.  The resolution also doesn''t seem great.  I like the sea of veterans - it just needs a anchor point, or a point of reference - an oject, a place, a person  -', '2004-11-15 18:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012363, 121342, 7628, '<td valign="top">Background is distracting, but dog looks very sweet.  Wish ear weren''t cropped off.</td>', 'Background is distracting, but dog looks very sweet.  Wish ear weren''t cropped off.', '2004-11-15 18:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012372, 121297, 12792, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this ties into Heros, unless you''re speaking of Hero of Much ado about nothing...  If I''m wrong, please email me and I''ll change my score, but for now, 4... sorry.</td>', 'Not sure how this ties into Heros, unless you''re speaking of Hero of Much ado about nothing...  If I''m wrong, please email me and I''ll change my score, but for now, 4... sorry.', '2004-11-15 18:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012374, 121030, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2004-11-15 18:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012376, 120894, 7628, '<td valign="top">creative processing - I like the effect  - an ordinary dog looks mythic.  There are odd and distracting shadows on the background.  Like that superman T-shirt!</td>', 'creative processing - I like the effect  - an ordinary dog looks mythic.  There are odd and distracting shadows on the background.  Like that superman T-shirt!', '2004-11-15 18:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012378, 121065, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice thought</td>', 'Nice thought', '2004-11-15 18:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012379, 121334, 12792, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this doesn''t do well for me.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this doesn''t do well for me.', '2004-11-15 18:27:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1012382, 121288, 12792, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but could have been better exicuted.  Frankly, your subject feels simply too broad.</td>', 'Good idea, but could have been better exicuted.  Frankly, your subject feels simply too broad.', '2004-11-15 18:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012386, 120575, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and very good composition.  I''d love it as a portrait!  Unfortunately, it doesn''t move me the way a good many others have.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Nice photo and very good composition.  I''d love it as a portrait!  Unfortunately, it doesn''t move me the way a good many others have.  Keep up the good work.', '2004-11-15 18:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012388, 120997, 7628, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea!  The lighting is well done.  I wish there weren''t creases on the background and that odd halo around the edge of the circle of light - a little selective blurring would make it more tidy.</td>', 'Excellent idea!  The lighting is well done.  I wish there weren''t creases on the background and that odd halo around the edge of the circle of light - a little selective blurring would make it more tidy.', '2004-11-15 18:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012389, 120641, 12792, '<td valign="top">Cute execution...</td>', 'Cute execution...', '2004-11-15 18:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012391, 121236, 20330, '<td valign="top">awww i love boxers, got one myself. lovely doggie :)</td>', 'awww i love boxers, got one myself. lovely doggie :)', '2004-11-15 18:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012400, 121416, 13602, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, my choice for the best in this challenge, simple yet a verry well told story, excellent depth and dramatism. Just great!</td>', 'Wonderful, my choice for the best in this challenge, simple yet a verry well told story, excellent depth and dramatism. Just great!', '2004-11-15 18:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012403, 120954, 7628, '<td valign="top">Charming family portrait.  The expression on the childs face is so adoring, and the dads have nice warmth to them.  Wish there weren''t the dark shadow from the child on the white shirt - softer lighting would be more appropriate here.</td>', 'Charming family portrait.  The expression on the childs face is so adoring, and the dads have nice warmth to them.  Wish there weren''t the dark shadow from the child on the white shirt - softer lighting would be more appropriate here.', '2004-11-15 18:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012406, 120907, 12792, '<td valign="top">Fun concept... You figure doesn''t emerge from the background, though.  The tree coming out of his shoulder doesn''t help.  I would have also liked to see his head.  Good effort, and great idea!</td>', 'Fun concept... You figure doesn''t emerge from the background, though.  The tree coming out of his shoulder doesn''t help.  I would have also liked to see his head.  Good effort, and great idea!', '2004-11-15 18:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012417, 120833, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice concept... the hellicopter actually overwhelms the trama team, especially the rear roter.  For me, my eyes keep drifting to the roter, not staying on the team.  I wish there was more of a feeling of intimacy here.<br/>Good luck and keep up the good work!</td>', 'Nice concept... the hellicopter actually overwhelms the trama team, especially the rear roter.  For me, my eyes keep drifting to the roter, not staying on the team.  I wish there was more of a feeling of intimacy here.Good luck and keep up the good work!', '2004-11-15 18:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012425, 120656, 12792, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the image feels quite out of balance and for me, it throws the rest of it all off.</td>', 'Good idea, but the image feels quite out of balance and for me, it throws the rest of it all off.', '2004-11-15 18:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012428, 121276, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait... would like to feel a bit closer... seem like too much head room.  Good work though</td>', 'Nice portrait... would like to feel a bit closer... seem like too much head room.  Good work though', '2004-11-15 18:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012430, 121352, 12792, '<td valign="top">Great looking dog, but the image compared with others, seems to pale.  No offence...</td>', 'Great looking dog, but the image compared with others, seems to pale.  No offence...', '2004-11-15 18:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012432, 121215, 12792, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but feels too detached.  I usually want to feel close to or at least closer to my heros.   Would have been great to have a closer look.</td>', 'Good subject, but feels too detached.  I usually want to feel close to or at least closer to my heros.   Would have been great to have a closer look.', '2004-11-15 18:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012437, 120626, 12792, '<td valign="top">At first I was thinking that a closer, more intimate look would have been better.  As I watched your image, I realized that it is intimate in a different way... it include''s the subjects surroundings and life tools.  Good work</td>', 'At first I was thinking that a closer, more intimate look would have been better.  As I watched your image, I realized that it is intimate in a different way... it include''s the subjects surroundings and life tools.  Good work', '2004-11-15 18:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012442, 121247, 12792, '<td valign="top">Great photo of the jag, but it doesn''t mesh w/subject for me.  I''m sorry...</td>', 'Great photo of the jag, but it doesn''t mesh w/subject for me.  I''m sorry...', '2004-11-15 18:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012447, 121102, 12792, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t get it, from the topic perspective.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t get it, from the topic perspective.', '2004-11-15 18:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012453, 121050, 12792, '<td valign="top">Not sure this fits "heros", but man that guy has sand!</td>', 'Not sure this fits "heros", but man that guy has sand!', '2004-11-15 18:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012456, 121401, 12792, '<td valign="top">Wicked image!  Sadlly, it doesn''t move me as many of the others have.  Please, keep up the good work!</td>', 'Wicked image!  Sadlly, it doesn''t move me as many of the others have.  Please, keep up the good work!', '2004-11-15 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012457, 121416, 26464, '<td valign="top">great shot and title.. would''ve liked to see some of the names a little more, but it''s obvious what this is.<br/></td>', 'great shot and title.. would''ve liked to see some of the names a little more, but it''s obvious what this is.', '2004-11-15 19:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012459, 121090, 26464, '<td valign="top">well done<br/></td>', 'well done', '2004-11-15 19:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012461, 120634, 12792, '<td valign="top">Excelent image... moving and great impact.   Truely speaks to me of pride, honor and love of same.  Congrats!</td>', 'Excelent image... moving and great impact.   Truely speaks to me of pride, honor and love of same.  Congrats!', '2004-11-15 19:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012464, 121337, 26464, '<td valign="top">the boy watching in the foreground makes the shot<br/></td>', 'the boy watching in the foreground makes the shot', '2004-11-15 19:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012465, 120641, 26464, '<td valign="top">LOL<br/></td>', 'LOL', '2004-11-15 19:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012469, 121358, 12792, '<td valign="top">Good image, but other moved me deeper.  Thank you for you submission and please, keep up the great work!</td>', 'Good image, but other moved me deeper.  Thank you for you submission and please, keep up the great work!', '2004-11-15 19:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012471, 120761, 26464, '<td valign="top">well done.. like an old portrait brought to life.<br/></td>', 'well done.. like an old portrait brought to life.', '2004-11-15 19:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1012475, 120997, 12792, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, but honestly doesn''t have the effect on me that many of the others have. Sorry, and good luck!</td>', 'Fun idea, but honestly doesn''t have the effect on me that many of the others have. Sorry, and good luck!', '2004-11-15 19:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
