(1012831, 121101, 22479, '<td valign="top">You have chosen a distinctive entry with an interesting perspective for this challenge. This photo has a lot of potential. However, there are several aspects which make it unacceptable to me. Most glaring is the dead space created by the rotation of this image. I would have cropped a little off the right and cloned in the sky. There is a strong blue cast which could have been removed with a levels adjustment. The statue could have been lightened with a curves/levels adjustment to show more detail. <br/> <br/>If you would like to see how I would have approached this photo, you can check my &lt;a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=121643"&gt; profile&lt;/a&gt;.</td>', 'You have chosen a distinctive entry with an interesting perspective for this challenge. This photo has a lot of potential. However, there are several aspects which make it unacceptable to me. Most glaring is the dead space created by the rotation of this image. I would have cropped a little off the right and cloned in the sky. There is a strong blue cast which could have been removed with a levels adjustment. The statue could have been lightened with a curves/levels adjustment to show more detail.  If you would like to see how I would have approached this photo, you can check my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=121643"> profile</a>.', '2004-11-15 22:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
