(1014153, 121276, 15029, '<td valign="top">incredible emotion. This should place in the top ten</td>', 'incredible emotion. This should place in the top ten', '2004-11-16 18:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014154, 120641, 15029, '<td valign="top">great motion blur. this really stands out<br/></td>', 'great motion blur. this really stands out', '2004-11-16 18:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014158, 120575, 15029, '<td valign="top">really impresive lighting</td>', 'really impresive lighting', '2004-11-16 18:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014169, 121358, 29544, '<td valign="top">This is a great "old school" photo. You can look into this as much as you like. It''s got the lot for me, but also lots of room for text as a dps.</td>', 'This is a great "old school" photo. You can look into this as much as you like. It''s got the lot for me, but also lots of room for text as a dps.', '2004-11-16 18:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014170, 121156, 19978, '<td valign="top">A great Woody idea. The overall noise level is a bit too much though.</td>', 'A great Woody idea. The overall noise level is a bit too much though.', '2004-11-16 18:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014172, 121352, 19978, '<td valign="top">This comes across largely as a snapshot without any really definable "hero" element. Freddy is a cute dog though.</td>', 'This comes across largely as a snapshot without any really definable "hero" element. Freddy is a cute dog though.', '2004-11-16 18:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014174, 121276, 19978, '<td valign="top">A wonderful and expressive portrait. Without any idea who he is or what his story is, the rugged looks, the pensive expression, the hunched posture... they all speak of emotion and drama. I like this shot a lot and would love to know who he is and why he represents a hero. I would have suggested a slightly tighter crop. Nice shot.</td>', 'A wonderful and expressive portrait. Without any idea who he is or what his story is, the rugged looks, the pensive expression, the hunched posture... they all speak of emotion and drama. I like this shot a lot and would love to know who he is and why he represents a hero. I would have suggested a slightly tighter crop. Nice shot.', '2004-11-16 18:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014177, 120954, 19978, '<td valign="top">I think "My two dads" would have been more than enough explanation. I love the concept and emotional impact of this photo. Having said that, the execution is technically inadequate. The lighting was not up to the task. I''m bumping the score though just because the message, for me, is truly heroic. Bravo to you for making such a necessary statement with your entry to this challenge!</td>', 'I think "My two dads" would have been more than enough explanation. I love the concept and emotional impact of this photo. Having said that, the execution is technically inadequate. The lighting was not up to the task. I''m bumping the score though just because the message, for me, is truly heroic. Bravo to you for making such a necessary statement with your entry to this challenge!', '2004-11-16 18:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014220, 121276, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice self portrait Zeus!  Moody atmosphere and all...I would have cropped it a tad tighter.</td>', 'Nice self portrait Zeus!  Moody atmosphere and all...I would have cropped it a tad tighter.', '2004-11-16 19:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014230, 120761, 11518, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this photo has been ruined by the selective desaturation.  This would have been a lot better either in colour or in black and white or sepia, not in between.</td>', 'Sorry but this photo has been ruined by the selective desaturation.  This would have been a lot better either in colour or in black and white or sepia, not in between.', '2004-11-16 19:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014232, 121208, 22386, '<td valign="top">Good composition with the white headstone in the last corner third</td>', 'Good composition with the white headstone in the last corner third', '2004-11-16 19:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014256, 120954, 4380, '<td valign="top">the kid''s expressions is the best element in this photo, excellent portrait...kudos.</td>', 'the kid''s expressions is the best element in this photo, excellent portrait...kudos.', '2004-11-16 19:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014345, 121243, 3447, '<td valign="top">Photographs are about emotion.   Those of us who were close do remember.  With your photograph perhaps you will remind others who are too young to know.<br/></td>', 'Photographs are about emotion.   Those of us who were close do remember.  With your photograph perhaps you will remind others who are too young to know.', '2004-11-16 20:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014353, 120576, 3447, '<td valign="top">This is more than a photograph.  Our generation does remember who our heroes are, and why.   A fine photograph...and if you could talk for a while with this old warrior it would add to your understanding of the duties we have in life.</td>', 'This is more than a photograph.  Our generation does remember who our heroes are, and why.   A fine photograph...and if you could talk for a while with this old warrior it would add to your understanding of the duties we have in life.', '2004-11-16 20:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014360, 121336, 24715, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, focus, and overall execution. Not quite fond of the background. And where is the fuzzy wig? ;-)</td>', 'Great lighting, focus, and overall execution. Not quite fond of the background. And where is the fuzzy wig? ;-)', '2004-11-16 20:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014368, 121200, 3447, '<td valign="top">There is nothing more to be said.   We survivors reflect on why we are still here, and our comrades are long since gone from this earth.   Let us be grateful for our great country, and never forget those brave souls who must bleed to keep it so.</td>', 'There is nothing more to be said.   We survivors reflect on why we are still here, and our comrades are long since gone from this earth.   Let us be grateful for our great country, and never forget those brave souls who must bleed to keep it so.', '2004-11-16 20:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014383, 120761, 3447, '<td valign="top">The Colonel has been there!  He has seen the elephant...let the miserable whiners and professional protesters hang their heads in abject shame.   This man personifies all that is great and admirable about our USA military...and if you will open your eyes and minds to see his top row, third from left decoration, you will see why our country is still free and open, and truthfully the envy of the entire world.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'The Colonel has been there!  He has seen the elephant...let the miserable whiners and professional protesters hang their heads in abject shame.   This man personifies all that is great and admirable about our USA military...and if you will open your eyes and minds to see his top row, third from left decoration, you will see why our country is still free and open, and truthfully the envy of the entire world.   ', '2004-11-16 21:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014399, 120954, 19035, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.</td>', 'Nice portrait.', '2004-11-16 21:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014463, 121006, 472, '<td valign="top">love this.  great capture. how did you get this?</td>', 'love this.  great capture. how did you get this?', '2004-11-16 21:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014468, 121217, 472, '<td valign="top">good for her. plus she''s cute! i only wish the picture wasnt a standard flash snapshot</td>', 'good for her. plus she''s cute! i only wish the picture wasnt a standard flash snapshot', '2004-11-16 21:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014470, 121181, 472, '<td valign="top">how is this a hero? just wondering.</td>', 'how is this a hero? just wondering.', '2004-11-16 21:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014472, 121358, 472, '<td valign="top">this is great</td>', 'this is great', '2004-11-16 21:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014476, 120030, 472, '<td valign="top">wow. that''s an amazing picture.</td>', 'wow. that''s an amazing picture.', '2004-11-16 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014480, 121336, 472, '<td valign="top">my favorite so far</td>', 'my favorite so far', '2004-11-16 21:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014486, 120575, 472, '<td valign="top">very nice shot. i like the model and the lighting.</td>', 'very nice shot. i like the model and the lighting.', '2004-11-16 22:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014624, 121416, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perfect! 10</td>', 'Perfect! 10', '2004-11-16 23:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015458, 121217, 93, '<td valign="top">Obviously taken with the flash, these types of photographs are always difficult to keep from looking "snapshottish".  A great idea, but ultimately, not much of a DPC contender because of the harsh lighting, the lack of focus (And trust me, I know how hard it is to focus in the dark), and the general lack of composition.</td>', 'Obviously taken with the flash, these types of photographs are always difficult to keep from looking "snapshottish".  A great idea, but ultimately, not much of a DPC contender because of the harsh lighting, the lack of focus (And trust me, I know how hard it is to focus in the dark), and the general lack of composition.', '2004-11-17 04:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015462, 121270, 93, '<td valign="top">Your white balance is a little off, still too much red in the skin tone and yellows in the paper.  The focus is also, to me, too far off the comic book (Tintin was always one of my favorites growing up), and thus the connection to the challenge is pretty weak.</td>', 'Your white balance is a little off, still too much red in the skin tone and yellows in the paper.  The focus is also, to me, too far off the comic book (Tintin was always one of my favorites growing up), and thus the connection to the challenge is pretty weak.', '2004-11-17 04:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015463, 120697, 93, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but feel the border is a little extraneous.   The connection to the challenge also seems quite a bit forced.  Not sure that any musician really hits the "hero" mark in my book.</td>', 'I like this shot, but feel the border is a little extraneous.   The connection to the challenge also seems quite a bit forced.  Not sure that any musician really hits the "hero" mark in my book.', '2004-11-17 04:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015466, 121344, 93, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little dark, making it hard to focus on your subject. Composition isn''t all that strong, in my opinion, either.  Not sure why you went with the perspective you did, but the cut off of the grave marker at the bottom makes the photograph seem a little rushed.</td>', 'Lighting is a little dark, making it hard to focus on your subject. Composition isn''t all that strong, in my opinion, either.  Not sure why you went with the perspective you did, but the cut off of the grave marker at the bottom makes the photograph seem a little rushed.', '2004-11-17 04:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015467, 120634, 93, '<td valign="top">The selective desat here is a nice idea, but I feel that the surrounding image is a little *too* dark, as well as the colored photo.   The rose is extremely hard to pick out, as well as any other object besides the hat.   A touching photograph, but lacks punch because of the lighting.  <br/>Another thing you could try is having the subject photograph larger.</td>', 'The selective desat here is a nice idea, but I feel that the surrounding image is a little *too* dark, as well as the colored photo.   The rose is extremely hard to pick out, as well as any other object besides the hat.   A touching photograph, but lacks punch because of the lighting.  Another thing you could try is having the subject photograph larger.', '2004-11-17 04:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015468, 121068, 93, '<td valign="top">I assume that this man is a personal hero of yours, but it''s difficult to really connect it to the challenge.  Your subject is a little too far away, and lighting is a bit harsh on him.  I would have played with more angles and perspectives, and perhaps had a closer shot with him and the gas pump(s), giving a stronger connection to the "restoration" aspect.</td>', 'I assume that this man is a personal hero of yours, but it''s difficult to really connect it to the challenge.  Your subject is a little too far away, and lighting is a bit harsh on him.  I would have played with more angles and perspectives, and perhaps had a closer shot with him and the gas pump(s), giving a stronger connection to the "restoration" aspect.', '2004-11-17 04:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015471, 121065, 93, '<td valign="top">Lacking focus, and the lighting is a little flat.   Composition is a little weak as well, as gollumn''s feet are cut off on the right.  An interesting idea, but execution needs some work.  Also, as you''re probably aware, DPC kind of has a hate-on for shots of toys :)</td>', 'Lacking focus, and the lighting is a little flat.   Composition is a little weak as well, as gollumn''s feet are cut off on the right.  An interesting idea, but execution needs some work.  Also, as you''re probably aware, DPC kind of has a hate-on for shots of toys :)', '2004-11-17 04:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015473, 121342, 93, '<td valign="top">Too much like a snapshot, in my opinion, and the connection to the challenge is tenuous at best.</td>', 'Too much like a snapshot, in my opinion, and the connection to the challenge is tenuous at best.', '2004-11-17 04:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015477, 120710, 93, '<td valign="top">This is an O.K. studio shot with a few technical flaws.  The focus is off, as the face of the dog looks a little OOF (it seems as though the focus area fell on the collar).  Lighting is ok, but needed a little more highlight on the eye and ears.  You also have some vignetting in the corners.</td>', 'This is an O.K. studio shot with a few technical flaws.  The focus is off, as the face of the dog looks a little OOF (it seems as though the focus area fell on the collar).  Lighting is ok, but needed a little more highlight on the eye and ears.  You also have some vignetting in the corners.', '2004-11-17 04:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015532, 120899, 29168, '<td valign="top">Wow. I''ve never even personally been to war. but this image touches me as if I had. It''s challenging to decide whether any war in general is heroric or not of course, but the personal sacrifice by each and every soldier, onboth sides, has to be heroric in nature. Surely?! This gets a nine from me because it''s so well composed and so emotively stimulating. Well done!</td>', 'Wow. I''ve never even personally been to war. but this image touches me as if I had. It''s challenging to decide whether any war in general is heroric or not of course, but the personal sacrifice by each and every soldier, onboth sides, has to be heroric in nature. Surely?! This gets a nine from me because it''s so well composed and so emotively stimulating. Well done!', '2004-11-17 05:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015540, 120954, 29168, '<td valign="top">Excellent title.</td>', 'Excellent title.', '2004-11-17 05:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015542, 121334, 29168, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. Maybe some grain, blur or less contrast would add to the urgent night scene? 8, based mostly on compostion and cropping. This would make a good wall poster indeed :)</td>', 'Very interesting composition. Maybe some grain, blur or less contrast would add to the urgent night scene? 8, based mostly on compostion and cropping. This would make a good wall poster indeed :)', '2004-11-17 05:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015545, 120907, 29168, '<td valign="top">Well now! This would have been just awesome with some artistic blur or brush strokes or something added, perhaps selectively (was that allowed?) Not your everyday photo! 8.</td>', 'Well now! This would have been just awesome with some artistic blur or brush strokes or something added, perhaps selectively (was that allowed?) Not your everyday photo! 8.', '2004-11-17 05:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015550, 121156, 29168, '<td valign="top">Nice style :) Some may argue, but I''m giving this an 8. It''s great composition and lighting for just the right effect. Very humorous (not to be insulting your hero or anything!).</td>', 'Nice style :) Some may argue, but I''m giving this an 8. It''s great composition and lighting for just the right effect. Very humorous (not to be insulting your hero or anything!).', '2004-11-17 06:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015561, 120575, 29168, '<td valign="top">Love the title. I never knew that? Really? Figures! S/he certainly was a hero whatever the case! :) Lighting is perhaps a little too hard (my monitor?) 7.</td>', 'Love the title. I never knew that? Really? Figures! S/he certainly was a hero whatever the case! :) Lighting is perhaps a little too hard (my monitor?) 7.', '2004-11-17 06:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015571, 119919, 29168, '<td valign="top">Heroes seem somehow more appropriate framed so dead center yes? Excellent lighting, exposure and focus. 8.</td>', 'Heroes seem somehow more appropriate framed so dead center yes? Excellent lighting, exposure and focus. 8.', '2004-11-17 06:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015610, 121276, 29168, '<td valign="top">I just love the way you got the "hurry up and take the damn shot!" expressioin so wonderfully heroic looking! (humor intended). Serioulsy, whoever this model is, I''ll be damned if he aint known heroism first hand! EXCELLENT composition and pose. Aperture, lighting, exposure, etc. - perfect. 10.</td>', 'I just love the way you got the "hurry up and take the damn shot!" expressioin so wonderfully heroic looking! (humor intended). Serioulsy, whoever this model is, I''ll be damned if he aint known heroism first hand! EXCELLENT composition and pose. Aperture, lighting, exposure, etc. - perfect. 10.', '2004-11-17 06:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015611, 120962, 29168, '<td valign="top">Wow. How *did* you get this pose? Love the post editing. Constrast, lighting, composition and crop - it''s all perfect imo. 10. You''re a true artist! Well done!</td>', 'Wow. How *did* you get this pose? Love the post editing. Constrast, lighting, composition and crop - it''s all perfect imo. 10. You''re a true artist! Well done!', '2004-11-17 06:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015762, 121090, 19816, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. very nicely done.Good Luck</td>', 'Cute idea. very nicely done.Good Luck', '2004-11-17 08:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015767, 120641, 19816, '<td valign="top">You can see the string just a tad other than that i Love This Shot. Good Luck!  8</td>', 'You can see the string just a tad other than that i Love This Shot. Good Luck!  8', '2004-11-17 08:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015772, 121006, 19816, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Best of Luck</td>', 'Great shot! Best of Luck', '2004-11-17 08:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015774, 120962, 19816, '<td valign="top">I like the soft touch you added.Moms truly are  HEROES!!</td>', 'I like the soft touch you added.Moms truly are  HEROES!!', '2004-11-17 08:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015776, 121156, 19816, '<td valign="top">This Just Mad me laugh a nice way to start my morning.I like it very much.Good Luck</td>', 'This Just Mad me laugh a nice way to start my morning.I like it very much.Good Luck', '2004-11-17 08:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015781, 121416, 19816, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot !! Truly Heroes! 9</td>', 'Very nice shot !! Truly Heroes! 9', '2004-11-17 08:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015787, 120997, 19816, '<td valign="top">Cute!! Lighting is great love the idea. Good Luck!</td>', 'Cute!! Lighting is great love the idea. Good Luck!', '2004-11-17 08:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015792, 121418, 19816, '<td valign="top">To much white for me but the photo is nice.Good Luck</td>', 'To much white for me but the photo is nice.Good Luck', '2004-11-17 08:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015805, 120575, 19816, '<td valign="top">Beautifuly done. This phot is at the top of my list. 10</td>', 'Beautifuly done. This phot is at the top of my list. 10', '2004-11-17 08:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015813, 121243, 19816, '<td valign="top">This phot speaks.Truly a Heroe!!</td>', 'This phot speaks.Truly a Heroe!!', '2004-11-17 08:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015817, 120697, 19816, '<td valign="top">IMHO the skin tone is not very good and the phot seems grainy to me.But maybe that is what you were going for.Good Luck</td>', 'IMHO the skin tone is not very good and the phot seems grainy to me.But maybe that is what you were going for.Good Luck', '2004-11-17 08:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015824, 121361, 19816, '<td valign="top">Looks like you needed to touch up on the boys foot and shorts.Try zooming in more so you can see better IMHO.Good Luck</td>', 'Looks like you needed to touch up on the boys foot and shorts.Try zooming in more so you can see better IMHO.Good Luck', '2004-11-17 08:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015827, 121405, 19816, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in your photo. Best Of Luck!!</td>', 'I like the lighting in your photo. Best Of Luck!!', '2004-11-17 08:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016232, 120962, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the way you`ve framed this and I also like the selective desat and soft focus..but I think you are very brave for using the two techniques together as they are very unpopular at the moment with some voters.<br/>Not me though.....8</td>', 'I like the way you`ve framed this and I also like the selective desat and soft focus..but I think you are very brave for using the two techniques together as they are very unpopular at the moment with some voters.Not me though.....8', '2004-11-17 11:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016241, 121200, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very apt and also suits the desat treatment.<br/></td>', 'Very apt and also suits the desat treatment.', '2004-11-17 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016289, 120641, 14603, '<td valign="top">I don`t normally go for images that use "props" but this one is an exception as you have used it well to convey the effect.<br/>Good work.</td>', 'I don`t normally go for images that use "props" but this one is an exception as you have used it well to convey the effect.Good work.', '2004-11-17 11:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016353, 120710, 10686, '<td valign="top">The collar makes it.</td>', 'The collar makes it.', '2004-11-17 11:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016393, 121334, 9452, '<td valign="top">If you think you have any chance to get ribboned with this shot..... you''r damn right! 10</td>', 'If you think you have any chance to get ribboned with this shot..... you''r damn right! 10', '2004-11-17 11:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016403, 120899, 10686, '<td valign="top">His expression looks a bit goofy, but this shot is still one of the best, the blurring around the edges and whatever you did to make it look like B&amp;W nightvision really work. - 10</td>', 'His expression looks a bit goofy, but this shot is still one of the best, the blurring around the edges and whatever you did to make it look like B&W nightvision really work. - 10', '2004-11-17 11:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
