(1018904, 121334, 93, '<td valign="top">My seocond favorite of the challenge.  Shows some extremely good creativity, and man.. a latex/rubber body suit? Where''d you come up with THAT!?<br/> <br/>Great shot.</td>', 'My seocond favorite of the challenge.  Shows some extremely good creativity, and man.. a latex/rubber body suit? Where''d you come up with THAT!? Great shot.', '2004-11-18 02:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
