(1018910, 121050, 93, '<td valign="top">Although this is a good photo (although it seems there''s some artifacting in the spray), I just don''t see a strong connection in the challenge.  Is he "heroic" for standing there?  I don''t think so.  Courageously stupid maybe :)</td>', 'Although this is a good photo (although it seems there''s some artifacting in the spray), I just don''t see a strong connection in the challenge.  Is he "heroic" for standing there?  I don''t think so.  Courageously stupid maybe :)', '2004-11-18 02:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
