(1019850, 121276, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait!  You''ve captured a definite mood/emotion with this shot.  Alot of character which is what a good portrait is all about IMHO.  Very nice lighting and good details.  My only crit.... maybe just a wee bit tighter crop but that''s all personal taste anyways.  Wonderful Job!</td>', 'This is a great portrait!  You''ve captured a definite mood/emotion with this shot.  Alot of character which is what a good portrait is all about IMHO.  Very nice lighting and good details.  My only crit.... maybe just a wee bit tighter crop but that''s all personal taste anyways.  Wonderful Job!', '2004-11-18 14:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
