(1020685, 120576, 10818, '<td valign="top">Fatastic portrait, very emotive.  The expression says it all.</td>', 'Fatastic portrait, very emotive.  The expression says it all.', '2004-11-18 20:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020692, 120641, 10818, '<td valign="top">I dont vote toys too high nornally, but this well done and puts a smile on my face.</td>', 'I dont vote toys too high nornally, but this well done and puts a smile on my face.', '2004-11-18 20:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020703, 121331, 10818, '<td valign="top">Look at those eyes, my gosh what an adorable kid, great photo too !</td>', 'Look at those eyes, my gosh what an adorable kid, great photo too !', '2004-11-18 20:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021284, 120311, 93, '<td valign="top">I just don''t feel that this is a very strong photograph, in technique, presentation, or story.  Focus is soft, depth of field is off (back focused on the child, but leaving the "hero" our of focus), contrast is low causing a flat look, and there''s just no real kick to the composition.</td>', 'I just don''t feel that this is a very strong photograph, in technique, presentation, or story.  Focus is soft, depth of field is off (back focused on the child, but leaving the "hero" our of focus), contrast is low causing a flat look, and there''s just no real kick to the composition.', '2004-11-19 00:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021286, 121241, 93, '<td valign="top">The backlighting would be more effective in this photo, in my opinion, if the sun were further below the horizon, and not causing such a hash, and painful, blowout.  I feel there is also too much negative space at the bottom of the image, which takes away from the shot compositionally.  A little more room left on the right hand side would have helped as well.</td>', 'The backlighting would be more effective in this photo, in my opinion, if the sun were further below the horizon, and not causing such a hash, and painful, blowout.  I feel there is also too much negative space at the bottom of the image, which takes away from the shot compositionally.  A little more room left on the right hand side would have helped as well.', '2004-11-19 00:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021293, 121288, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid that I find this shot poorly exposed, not framed very well, taken from too great a distance, and out of focus.  In essence, a very mediocre snapshot.<br/> <br/>Technical aspects aside, while firefighters *do* do heroic deeds everyday, this shot doesn''t do a lot to invoke that heroism in my eyes.</td>', 'I''m afraid that I find this shot poorly exposed, not framed very well, taken from too great a distance, and out of focus.  In essence, a very mediocre snapshot. Technical aspects aside, while firefighters *do* do heroic deeds everyday, this shot doesn''t do a lot to invoke that heroism in my eyes.', '2004-11-19 00:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021303, 120726, 93, '<td valign="top">I thinks that a closer crop would have helped here.  I feel that the flags aren''t extremely vital to the piece, and seem like "patriotic" filler. (please don''t take that negatively.)  A nicer, closer and crisper view of the Veterans would have been great to see.</td>', 'I thinks that a closer crop would have helped here.  I feel that the flags aren''t extremely vital to the piece, and seem like "patriotic" filler. (please don''t take that negatively.)  A nicer, closer and crisper view of the Veterans would have been great to see.', '2004-11-19 00:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021310, 121302, 93, '<td valign="top">I like the humor content here, and your composition is great.  However, white balance and focus seem to be slightly off. (too much "yellow"), and there seems to have been a bit of over-sharpening to compensate for the focus.. at least, that''s what I see.</td>', 'I like the humor content here, and your composition is great.  However, white balance and focus seem to be slightly off. (too much "yellow"), and there seems to have been a bit of over-sharpening to compensate for the focus.. at least, that''s what I see.', '2004-11-19 01:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021313, 121364, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice, simple entry with some good lighting (although your color balance could use less yellow).  The textures are really god, but I don''t really like how it fades out so quickly on the left hand side.and the DOF seems to suffer on the foreground 84 (on the arm), and on the player''s name.</td>', 'A nice, simple entry with some good lighting (although your color balance could use less yellow).  The textures are really god, but I don''t really like how it fades out so quickly on the left hand side.and the DOF seems to suffer on the foreground 84 (on the arm), and on the player''s name.', '2004-11-19 01:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021401, 120907, 15511, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. The tree "growing" out of the right shoulder is a bit distracting, as it appears similar to the material on the arms and legs.</td>', 'Interesting image. The tree "growing" out of the right shoulder is a bit distracting, as it appears similar to the material on the arms and legs.', '2004-11-19 01:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
