(1021812, 119919, 1280, '<td valign="top">The colour is good,and kinda grabs ya.  Since this is obviously a set up shot, and you had time to compose, I''m sorry you cut his feet short.  Other than that I''m not too impressed with the use of a doll, but overall you did a good job.</td>', 'The colour is good,and kinda grabs ya.  Since this is obviously a set up shot, and you had time to compose, I''m sorry you cut his feet short.  Other than that I''m not too impressed with the use of a doll, but overall you did a good job.', '2004-11-19 09:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021816, 121334, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good!</td>', 'Very good!', '2004-11-19 09:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021821, 120575, 1280, '<td valign="top">Excellent job.  ONe of my top faves. Inspiring work. :)</td>', 'Excellent job.  ONe of my top faves. Inspiring work. :)', '2004-11-19 09:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021827, 120658, 1280, '<td valign="top">YES!  I always appreciate anyone who serves the poor.  Good job!</td>', 'YES!  I always appreciate anyone who serves the poor.  Good job!', '2004-11-19 09:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021828, 120641, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good camera work, wonderful colours that pop, I guess it meets the challenge in a comical way.</td>', 'Good camera work, wonderful colours that pop, I guess it meets the challenge in a comical way.', '2004-11-19 09:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021832, 120710, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  Dogs are so loyal.  I get a kick out of his "spiked" collar. 9</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  Dogs are so loyal.  I get a kick out of his "spiked" collar. 9', '2004-11-19 09:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021840, 121276, 1280, '<td valign="top">VG portrait. A face worth studying.</td>', 'VG portrait. A face worth studying.', '2004-11-19 09:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021859, 120997, 93, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph a lot.  Your use of light and shadow is extremely effective, and the idea is creative, original, and humorous.   Great job, and thank you for daring to be different.</td>', 'I like this photograph a lot.  Your use of light and shadow is extremely effective, and the idea is creative, original, and humorous.   Great job, and thank you for daring to be different.', '2004-11-19 09:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021865, 119919, 93, '<td valign="top">While toys aren''t exactly the most .. inspiring subjects ever, you''ve really pulled off a wonderful photograph here.  I love the soft lighting, and the color matching.  Great work.</td>', 'While toys aren''t exactly the most .. inspiring subjects ever, you''ve really pulled off a wonderful photograph here.  I love the soft lighting, and the color matching.  Great work.', '2004-11-19 09:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021866, 121302, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the web goo on Spidey. I think this would have worked better if the subject was not dead on center in the frame, though</td>', 'I like the pose and the web goo on Spidey. I think this would have worked better if the subject was not dead on center in the frame, though', '2004-11-19 09:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021868, 120761, 8624, '<td valign="top">impressive array of medals!nicely composed portrait, but  I think the lighting is pretty flat here. The dark detail areas of the uniform are lost and his head gets lost a bit in the background.</td>', 'impressive array of medals!nicely composed portrait, but  I think the lighting is pretty flat here. The dark detail areas of the uniform are lost and his head gets lost a bit in the background.', '2004-11-19 09:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021976, 120575, 11518, '<td valign="top">My one and only 10! Love the light, composition and expression.  Well done!</td>', 'My one and only 10! Love the light, composition and expression.  Well done!', '2004-11-19 11:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022002, 120698, 29111, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit and desaturated. Excellent compositional lines too.</td>', 'Very nicely lit and desaturated. Excellent compositional lines too.', '2004-11-19 11:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022019, 120962, 27293, '<td valign="top">I like this, but it does not convey heroism to me. Also, in my opinion it would have been much better in just black and white, given the fact that is properly exposed and well done techncially. Selective desat adds a cheesy and cheap kind of look to it...</td>', 'I like this, but it does not convey heroism to me. Also, in my opinion it would have been much better in just black and white, given the fact that is properly exposed and well done techncially. Selective desat adds a cheesy and cheap kind of look to it...', '2004-11-19 11:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022036, 121068, 12332, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the emotion in the subject''s face, but the focus is a little soft</td>', 'I like the composition and the emotion in the subject''s face, but the focus is a little soft', '2004-11-19 12:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022045, 120907, 12332, '<td valign="top">great exposure for what could be a tough range of brightness - the juxtaposition of the most prominent background object (tree) through his torso should probably have been avoided</td>', 'great exposure for what could be a tough range of brightness - the juxtaposition of the most prominent background object (tree) through his torso should probably have been avoided', '2004-11-19 12:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022054, 121194, 12332, '<td valign="top">in my opinion, the focus is too soft and the composition suffers through the tilted horizon</td>', 'in my opinion, the focus is too soft and the composition suffers through the tilted horizon', '2004-11-19 12:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022067, 120707, 12332, '<td valign="top">A very tough shot, the darks are too dark and the white too light, and not much you could do about it.  Did they play "Space Truckin''"?</td>', 'A very tough shot, the darks are too dark and the white too light, and not much you could do about it.  Did they play "Space Truckin''"?', '2004-11-19 12:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022083, 121270, 12332, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the hero reference (no deduct).  Photo would benefit from eliminating distracting elements in the background, and by improving the focus.  If you have editing software, the brightness/levels/curves/contrast controls could also bring it more life (i.e., it''s kinda flat color-wise).</td>', 'I''m missing the hero reference (no deduct).  Photo would benefit from eliminating distracting elements in the background, and by improving the focus.  If you have editing software, the brightness/levels/curves/contrast controls could also bring it more life (i.e., it''s kinda flat color-wise).', '2004-11-19 12:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022090, 120311, 12332, '<td valign="top">The sharpest focus appears to be on the shoulder of the boy''s coat - should be on the toy, or the boy''s eyes.  I like the lighting situation in this photo.</td>', 'The sharpest focus appears to be on the shoulder of the boy''s coat - should be on the toy, or the boy''s eyes.  I like the lighting situation in this photo.', '2004-11-19 12:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022097, 121288, 12332, '<td valign="top">Just too murky, and the pickup trucks detract from the intended message, I think.  Maybe a zoom on the 3 doors with trucks on-the-ready would have served better.</td>', 'Just too murky, and the pickup trucks detract from the intended message, I think.  Maybe a zoom on the 3 doors with trucks on-the-ready would have served better.', '2004-11-19 12:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022103, 120899, 12332, '<td valign="top">This is very realistic. (I realize it might be real!)  The motion depiction adds an appropriate amount of tension, in my opinion, and outweighs the couple of highlights that were blown out.</td>', 'This is very realistic. (I realize it might be real!)  The motion depiction adds an appropriate amount of tension, in my opinion, and outweighs the couple of highlights that were blown out.', '2004-11-19 12:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022107, 120710, 12332, '<td valign="top">One of the best dog portraits I''ve ever voted on.  Congrats on a well-lighted and interesting shot</td>', 'One of the best dog portraits I''ve ever voted on.  Congrats on a well-lighted and interesting shot', '2004-11-19 12:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022109, 121416, 12332, '<td valign="top">very emotive - I like this shot a lot!</td>', 'very emotive - I like this shot a lot!', '2004-11-19 12:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022111, 121210, 12332, '<td valign="top">The mood and emotion is depicted beautifully here.</td>', 'The mood and emotion is depicted beautifully here.', '2004-11-19 12:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022116, 121006, 12332, '<td valign="top">Great shot, excellent "art direction"  I gave it an 8, could have been a 9 if not for the dust on his right shoulder.</td>', 'Great shot, excellent "art direction"  I gave it an 8, could have been a 9 if not for the dust on his right shoulder.', '2004-11-19 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022119, 121401, 12332, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured nostalgia beautifully here.</td>', 'You''ve captured nostalgia beautifully here.', '2004-11-19 12:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022123, 120576, 12332, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent portrait - the beret and the tie are just perfect "props" for the face which is filled with acquired wisdom.</td>', 'This is an excellent portrait - the beret and the tie are just perfect "props" for the face which is filled with acquired wisdom.', '2004-11-19 12:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022125, 121331, 12332, '<td valign="top">An excellent portrait and a beautiful baby!  Spot-on focus and vivid colors!!</td>', 'An excellent portrait and a beautiful baby!  Spot-on focus and vivid colors!!', '2004-11-19 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022127, 121276, 12332, '<td valign="top">Interesting face, nice lighting and great focus - we can tell that this is man who knows something important, even without a context of what that knowledge is.</td>', 'Interesting face, nice lighting and great focus - we can tell that this is man who knows something important, even without a context of what that knowledge is.', '2004-11-19 12:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022225, 121210, 29604, '<td valign="top">i like it.. reminds me of a shot from a M. Night movie.<br/>The only thing is, a cross made of new boards in timber? It lacks realism, in a sense...  a human wouldn''t be buried in the timber today, and if s/he was buried years ago, why does the cross have newly cut boards? My first impression was, a dead dog. But then again, who ever said dogs can''t be heros?</td>', 'i like it.. reminds me of a shot from a M. Night movie.The only thing is, a cross made of new boards in timber? It lacks realism, in a sense...  a human wouldn''t be buried in the timber today, and if s/he was buried years ago, why does the cross have newly cut boards? My first impression was, a dead dog. But then again, who ever said dogs can''t be heros?', '2004-11-19 13:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022310, 121279, 10720, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and shot, the lightest point is in the background and draws your eyes away however</td>', 'Nice idea and shot, the lightest point is in the background and draws your eyes away however', '2004-11-19 14:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022313, 121236, 10720, '<td valign="top">I really like the look and the DOF, another type of flash (or use of a 80/20 adapter on the flash could have taken care of the harsh shadows behind.</td>', 'I really like the look and the DOF, another type of flash (or use of a 80/20 adapter on the flash could have taken care of the harsh shadows behind.', '2004-11-19 14:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022471, 121416, 28199, '<td valign="top">What an emotional photo - perfect in black and white</td>', 'What an emotional photo - perfect in black and white', '2004-11-19 16:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022503, 120626, 28199, '<td valign="top">Working for a fire department I may be biased but I love this photo.  It may have been even more impactful if the red hose cart were a little lower or higher in the frame.</td>', 'Working for a fire department I may be biased but I love this photo.  It may have been even more impactful if the red hose cart were a little lower or higher in the frame.', '2004-11-19 16:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022511, 121156, 28199, '<td valign="top">Striking and dramatic colors!</td>', 'Striking and dramatic colors!', '2004-11-19 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022697, 121156, 25468, '<td valign="top">Woody''s back, and he''s bad! great in all aspects. 8</td>', 'Woody''s back, and he''s bad! great in all aspects. 8', '2004-11-19 18:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
