(1023665, 121424, 23913, '<td valign="top">i like the use of the lighting and shadow to create drama within the subject.<br/>i don''t like the angle as much it seems that these types of shots always have more power when the cross it shot from the bottom up.<br/>try it sometime its a diffrent angle thats all.<br/> <br/>well done good choice of subject matter.</td>', 'i like the use of the lighting and shadow to create drama within the subject.i don''t like the angle as much it seems that these types of shots always have more power when the cross it shot from the bottom up.try it sometime its a diffrent angle thats all. well done good choice of subject matter.', '2004-11-20 02:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023667, 121090, 23913, '<td valign="top">yeah buz!!:)<br/>i''m happy now<br/>intrusting lighting kinda noisy.<br/>also his arms don''t look like they are with his head they sorta look like they are out of a propper possition. ouch<br/> <br/>doesn''t hurt the shot though just poor Buz</td>', 'yeah buz!!:)i''m happy nowintrusting lighting kinda noisy.also his arms don''t look like they are with his head they sorta look like they are out of a propper possition. ouch doesn''t hurt the shot though just poor Buz', '2004-11-20 02:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023674, 120030, 23913, '<td valign="top">i lov the colour of this shot it is awsome ther green and the blue. it is a very well shot nicely framed vivid image.<br/> <br/>did i mention that i liked the colour and the colour.-LOL crazed w/this pic. very nice work</td>', 'i lov the colour of this shot it is awsome ther green and the blue. it is a very well shot nicely framed vivid image. did i mention that i liked the colour and the colour.-LOL crazed w/this pic. very nice work', '2004-11-20 02:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023677, 120726, 23913, '<td valign="top">there appears to be alot of burning done on this shot it is not well conceled and doesn''t blend w/the image.<br/>i seems unnessary and almost pops the flag and ppl out to the point where they look pasted on top of the backround.<br/> <br/>if it wern''t for that it would be a nice image...sorry (all IMO)</td>', 'there appears to be alot of burning done on this shot it is not well conceled and doesn''t blend w/the image.i seems unnessary and almost pops the flag and ppl out to the point where they look pasted on top of the backround. if it wern''t for that it would be a nice image...sorry (all IMO)', '2004-11-20 02:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023679, 120894, 23913, '<td valign="top">of all the dog shots in this challenge (and there are alot) this is by far the coolest as well as the most well done of any of them.<br/> <br/>the dog looks just right for the shot and gives that great i''m proud to be a dog look if only we knew what he was thinking... great shot well taken</td>', 'of all the dog shots in this challenge (and there are alot) this is by far the coolest as well as the most well done of any of them. the dog looks just right for the shot and gives that great i''m proud to be a dog look if only we knew what he was thinking... great shot well taken', '2004-11-20 02:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024005, 121215, 12332, '<td valign="top">with the subjects being so small, and in fact a minority in the picture, it subtracts from the impact</td>', 'with the subjects being so small, and in fact a minority in the picture, it subtracts from the impact', '2004-11-20 10:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
