(1024573, 120907, 93, '<td valign="top">This would be a much better shot if it had a more forgiving, and OOF background.  As it is, it''s far too cluttered, and he looks like he was impaled on that tree.</td>', 'This would be a much better shot if it had a more forgiving, and OOF background.  As it is, it''s far too cluttered, and he looks like he was impaled on that tree.', '2004-11-20 18:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024574, 121331, 93, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute picture, and well taken.  Slight over-exposure in areas, and a *little* weak on the challenge (aside from the personal), but a good job.  If this isn''t parrothead, it really reminds me of his work.</td>', 'This is such a cute picture, and well taken.  Slight over-exposure in areas, and a *little* weak on the challenge (aside from the personal), but a good job.  If this isn''t parrothead, it really reminds me of his work.', '2004-11-20 18:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
