(1026347, 121181, 12253, '<td valign="top">Title could mean your son is your hero,and I like the symmetry here.  However, a simple, get some snow on your tongue photo doesn''t really tell a hero''s story.</td>', 'Title could mean your son is your hero,and I like the symmetry here.  However, a simple, get some snow on your tongue photo doesn''t really tell a hero''s story.', '2004-11-21 23:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026349, 121194, 1054, '<td valign="top">This is a good concept but the composition could use some work. The girl standing is directly centered in the frame, which tends not to make for a strong composition. Also I personally find the dark horizon cuting right below her neck neck visually unappealing. A shallower depth of field may have helped in that regard. Finally, your horizon is tilted, which also tends to be visually troubling. Your color and contrast are excellent.</td>', 'This is a good concept but the composition could use some work. The girl standing is directly centered in the frame, which tends not to make for a strong composition. Also I personally find the dark horizon cuting right below her neck neck visually unappealing. A shallower depth of field may have helped in that regard. Finally, your horizon is tilted, which also tends to be visually troubling. Your color and contrast are excellent.', '2004-11-21 23:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026357, 121236, 1054, '<td valign="top">While I understand the watchdog concept, this photo in and of itself does not speak heroism to me. From a photographic standpoint, I find the lighting harsh and unappealing, looks like an on-camera fliash -- in any case a softer light (or multiple lights) would have softened the shadows and, in my opinion, made this photograph more appealing. Ultimately, I think the key to making a dog photograph work in this challenge would have been to photograph the dog *doing* something that suggested heroism.</td>', 'While I understand the watchdog concept, this photo in and of itself does not speak heroism to me. From a photographic standpoint, I find the lighting harsh and unappealing, looks like an on-camera fliash -- in any case a softer light (or multiple lights) would have softened the shadows and, in my opinion, made this photograph more appealing. Ultimately, I think the key to making a dog photograph work in this challenge would have been to photograph the dog *doing* something that suggested heroism.', '2004-11-21 23:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026359, 120030, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great colors here (even if a bit oversaturated).  Although real, the composition and colors make this surreal.  Not sure about the connection to Heroes, but the shot is great.</td>', 'Great colors here (even if a bit oversaturated).  Although real, the composition and colors make this surreal.  Not sure about the connection to Heroes, but the shot is great.', '2004-11-21 23:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026361, 121334, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nice -- could easily be a movie poster!  I am betting this will be a ribbon.</td>', 'Very nice -- could easily be a movie poster!  I am betting this will be a ribbon.', '2004-11-21 23:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026363, 120899, 3102, '<td valign="top">A remarkable shot -- I can''t imagine this one without a ribbon in just a little bit!  One of just a couple 10s this time, in my opinion.</td>', 'A remarkable shot -- I can''t imagine this one without a ribbon in just a little bit!  One of just a couple 10s this time, in my opinion.', '2004-11-21 23:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026364, 121416, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent job!  The toning is great, and it''s certainly an emotional shot.  Congrats on a job well done.</td>', 'Excellent job!  The toning is great, and it''s certainly an emotional shot.  Congrats on a job well done.', '2004-11-21 23:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026366, 121247, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice car photograph, but your title does not make this photograph about heroism.</td>', 'Nice car photograph, but your title does not make this photograph about heroism.', '2004-11-21 23:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026367, 121349, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent work!  I really like the way the reflection is worked in here.  One of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent work!  I really like the way the reflection is worked in here.  One of my favorites of the challenge.', '2004-11-21 23:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026371, 121416, 16301, '<td valign="top">VERY powerful photo! (10)</td>', 'VERY powerful photo! (10)', '2004-11-21 23:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026372, 120311, 1054, '<td valign="top">It seems the focus of this shot is on the child and not the action figure. Since this challenge is Heroes, and the action figure seems to be the subject, that''s probably where the focus should be.</td>', 'It seems the focus of this shot is on the child and not the action figure. Since this challenge is Heroes, and the action figure seems to be the subject, that''s probably where the focus should be.', '2004-11-21 23:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026375, 121270, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but a cluttered background. This might be better with just the man''s head and the comic book in the frame, with as little incidental background as is practival.</td>', 'Nice concept, but a cluttered background. This might be better with just the man''s head and the comic book in the frame, with as little incidental background as is practival.', '2004-11-21 23:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026377, 120698, 1054, '<td valign="top">A strong entry, but both the photograph and the title suggest more of an advertisement than heroism. Still good execution.</td>', 'A strong entry, but both the photograph and the title suggest more of an advertisement than heroism. Still good execution.', '2004-11-21 23:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026381, 120576, 1054, '<td valign="top">One of the strongest entries this challenge. Nicely done.</td>', 'One of the strongest entries this challenge. Nicely done.', '2004-11-21 23:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026384, 121401, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, almost an abstrack... it took me a moment to identify this as a fire truck. I''d have liked to see a shallower DOF to isolate the truck from the back wall.</td>', 'Nice shot, almost an abstrack... it took me a moment to identify this as a fire truck. I''d have liked to see a shallower DOF to isolate the truck from the back wall.', '2004-11-21 23:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026385, 120641, 1054, '<td valign="top">Funny, and good execution.</td>', 'Funny, and good execution.', '2004-11-21 23:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026388, 121352, 1054, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but although I understand the concept of a watchdig this entry does not speak Heroes to me. For it to work, I''d want to see the dog *doing* something that suggested heroism. As this is, it kust looks like a snapshot of a dog lying down outside.</td>', 'Sorry, but although I understand the concept of a watchdig this entry does not speak Heroes to me. For it to work, I''d want to see the dog *doing* something that suggested heroism. As this is, it kust looks like a snapshot of a dog lying down outside.', '2004-11-21 23:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026389, 121275, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.</td>', 'Excellent composition.', '2004-11-21 23:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026394, 120676, 1054, '<td valign="top">A good entry but I''d have preferred to see the hat on the left cropped out.</td>', 'A good entry but I''d have preferred to see the hat on the left cropped out.', '2004-11-21 23:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
