(1026531, 121424, 24065, '<td valign="top">Zoomdak, I was horrified to see the final score and comments.  I applaud your choice of subject and felt you portrayed our Hero in a very artisitic way.  The whole Hero challenge was a very profound statement on our time!  I shared it with my SS class today.  I gave you a high score during the challenge, but didn''t have time to leave a comment.  I hope that with 2 blue ribbons under your belt you won''t become discouraged because of this :-)<br/> <br/>In Him,<br/>Di</td>', 'Zoomdak, I was horrified to see the final score and comments.  I applaud your choice of subject and felt you portrayed our Hero in a very artisitic way.  The whole Hero challenge was a very profound statement on our time!  I shared it with my SS class today.  I gave you a high score during the challenge, but didn''t have time to leave a comment.  I hope that with 2 blue ribbons under your belt you won''t become discouraged because of this :-) In Him,Di', '2004-11-22 00:39:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1026537, 121416, 9906, '<td valign="top">This brings back incredible feelings.  I got to see the wall once.  I imediately burst into tears.  I have never seen an object so simple in form hold so much emotion.  I didn''t have time to vote on this challenge, but if I had, this may have been the only ten I''ve ever (woulda) given out.  I''m trying to hold back the tears now as I look at this.  Kudos.<br/>TC</td>', 'This brings back incredible feelings.  I got to see the wall once.  I imediately burst into tears.  I have never seen an object so simple in form hold so much emotion.  I didn''t have time to vote on this challenge, but if I had, this may have been the only ten I''ve ever (woulda) given out.  I''m trying to hold back the tears now as I look at this.  Kudos.TC', '2004-11-22 00:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1026541, 121416, 24065, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon!  And blue at that!! Well deserved &lt;&lt;pat on the back&gt;&gt;  :D</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon!  And blue at that!! Well deserved <<pat on the back>>  :D', '2004-11-22 00:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
