(1026566, 120576, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your yellow with this study that elevates the soul of man. So touching and so somber with such a deep meaning. Glorious, in one word!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-26 20:58:54.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on your yellow with this study that elevates the soul of man. So touching and so somber with such a deep meaning. Glorious, in one word!', '2004-11-22 01:07:25.000000', '2004-11-26 20:58:54.000000', 0),
