(1026854, 119712, 27161, '<td valign="top">This is by far my best picture.  Technically I think I met a lot of my personal challenges of not using too much contrast, and keeping the reflections of the bathroom light off the glossy paper.  <br/> <br/>I recieved some of my lowest scores in this challenge too.  I assume some of it is due to the content, but if there are other reasons please let me know.<br/> <br/>I think there are quite a few that disagreed to the applicability of Hugh Hefner to the theme of Hero:  (definition) A person noted for special achievement in a particular field: the heroes of medicine. In this sense of the definition I think this picture is applicable.  Although, it really doesn''t compare with the pictures of war veterans, which deservedly placed much better.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the great responses, Brian.</td>', 'This is by far my best picture.  Technically I think I met a lot of my personal challenges of not using too much contrast, and keeping the reflections of the bathroom light off the glossy paper.   I recieved some of my lowest scores in this challenge too.  I assume some of it is due to the content, but if there are other reasons please let me know. I think there are quite a few that disagreed to the applicability of Hugh Hefner to the theme of Hero:  (definition) A person noted for special achievement in a particular field: the heroes of medicine. In this sense of the definition I think this picture is applicable.  Although, it really doesn''t compare with the pictures of war veterans, which deservedly placed much better. Thanks for the great responses, Brian.', '2004-11-22 07:08:46.000000', NULL, 0),
