(1028474, 121416, 18450, '<td valign="top">This is an image that I sat and looked at for a long time.....it''s very powerful. To me the hands emphasised the fact that it''s not just a list of names .....those were people who''s lives were lost,families changed forever, it made me remember. Congrats on a very well deserved blue!!<br/> <br/>sue</td>', 'This is an image that I sat and looked at for a long time.....it''s very powerful. To me the hands emphasised the fact that it''s not just a list of names .....those were people who''s lives were lost,families changed forever, it made me remember. Congrats on a very well deserved blue!! sue', '2004-11-23 06:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1028578, 121337, 12792, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments and encouragement.   The chance of catching the young boy, standing at near attention, completely enthralled with the newly blue young soldier, the drill sergeant and the interaction of pride between the two of them told the perfect story for me.   Bassed upon the feedback, the image has touched a good many of you too. <br/> <br/>  This photo was the culmination of several emotional days as my son (not in picture) graduated from the Infantry Training Brigade at Ft Benning.  During that time, and the weeks running up to Turning Blue, I learned of the significance of the [blue] rope and the honor that it symbolizes on each of these young men volunteers all.   Its one thing to be drafted, but the volunteers  that come into the army, be them National Guard, Reservists or regular Army are heroes all.<br/></td>', 'Thank you all for your comments and encouragement.   The chance of catching the young boy, standing at near attention, completely enthralled with the newly blue young soldier, the drill sergeant and the interaction of pride between the two of them told the perfect story for me.   Bassed upon the feedback, the image has touched a good many of you too.    This photo was the culmination of several emotional days as my son (not in picture) graduated from the Infantry Training Brigade at Ft Benning.  During that time, and the weeks running up to Turning Blue, I learned of the significance of the [blue] rope and the honor that it symbolizes on each of these young men volunteers all.   Its one thing to be drafted, but the volunteers  that come into the army, be them National Guard, Reservists or regular Army are heroes all.', '2004-11-23 09:01:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1028596, 121416, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice work CJ, well done!</td>', 'Nice work CJ, well done!', '2004-11-23 09:19:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1028652, 121416, 7560, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot when you first showed it to me. My only 10 of the challenge. Perfect DOF, nice sharp focus, and black and white was the perfect choice for the shot. This just proves that you and I need to go shooting more often. ;) Nice job pal!</td>', 'I liked this shot when you first showed it to me. My only 10 of the challenge. Perfect DOF, nice sharp focus, and black and white was the perfect choice for the shot. This just proves that you and I need to go shooting more often. ;) Nice job pal!', '2004-11-23 10:28:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1028658, 120576, 7560, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon! Very nice example of a candid portrait. The crop is a bit tight, but I figure there were probably some background elements that you were trying to eliminate. :) I''d love to know this guy''s story. Well done!</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon! Very nice example of a candid portrait. The crop is a bit tight, but I figure there were probably some background elements that you were trying to eliminate. :) I''d love to know this guy''s story. Well done!', '2004-11-23 10:31:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1028665, 121349, 7560, '<td valign="top">This means you were out at the same time ClubJuggle and I were. Drop me a line and we can go shooting some time. :) This is a very nicely done shot of the Wall. Getting the reflection in the right place is harder than people think, so I appreciate the effort you put into this one. :) Nice work.</td>', 'This means you were out at the same time ClubJuggle and I were. Drop me a line and we can go shooting some time. :) This is a very nicely done shot of the Wall. Getting the reflection in the right place is harder than people think, so I appreciate the effort you put into this one. :) Nice work.', '2004-11-23 10:34:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1028666, 120698, 7560, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot a bunch. Looks like it came right out of a recruiting poster. Nice sharp colors and details. Excellent work. Go Navy!</td>', 'I really liked this shot a bunch. Looks like it came right out of a recruiting poster. Nice sharp colors and details. Excellent work. Go Navy!', '2004-11-23 10:35:21.000000', NULL, 0),
