(1028671, 121006, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice job hitting top 10! You rock. :) On the technical side, I think sepia might have been a better coloring choice for the subject. But that''s just me. :)</td>', 'Nice job hitting top 10! You rock. :) On the technical side, I think sepia might have been a better coloring choice for the subject. But that''s just me. :)', '2004-11-23 10:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
