(1033551, 121302, 24990, '<td valign="top">*C*C*<br/>Very humerous shot.  I notice that spideys (His right) hand is out of focus slightly, it would have looked real good to have him pin sharp.  There is also a lot of negative space here.  Perhaps a tighter crop or crpping him slightly to one side would have changed the impact.  Overall a good pic, funny, and the lighting on the subject is good.<br/></td>', '*C*C*Very humerous shot.  I notice that spideys (His right) hand is out of focus slightly, it would have looked real good to have him pin sharp.  There is also a lot of negative space here.  Perhaps a tighter crop or crpping him slightly to one side would have changed the impact.  Overall a good pic, funny, and the lighting on the subject is good.', '2004-11-26 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 0),
