(1057678, 120657, 6900, '<td valign="top">I like the meaning of this image.  It reminds me that not everyone who dies in war is Rambo - a 25 to 35 year old WAR GOD or something.  Some "veterans" of the Korean War, WW I and II were vets at 19.  That being said, there are a few parts of the image that are blown out - but otherwise I like the composition and imagery.<br/> <br/>M</td>', 'I like the meaning of this image.  It reminds me that not everyone who dies in war is Rambo - a 25 to 35 year old WAR GOD or something.  Some "veterans" of the Korean War, WW I and II were vets at 19.  That being said, there are a few parts of the image that are blown out - but otherwise I like the composition and imagery. M', '2004-12-11 20:21:12.000000', NULL, 0),
