(1098661, 121252, 18080, '<td valign="top">Hi commenters,<br/>Just to answer a few points...<br/>I choose to focus on names that were the same in an attempt to show that millions have died. I also chose the shallow DOF for the same reason. This is a commenorative plauque in Glasgo Central Train Station in Scotland.<br/>Thamks for all the comments and votes<br/> <br/>Kev<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-07 13:39:00.</i></td>', 'Hi commenters,Just to answer a few points...I choose to focus on names that were the same in an attempt to show that millions have died. I also chose the shallow DOF for the same reason. This is a commenorative plauque in Glasgo Central Train Station in Scotland.Thamks for all the comments and votes Kev', '2005-01-09 18:11:42.000000', '2005-09-07 14:39:00.000000', 0),
