(1679836, 120907, 43778, '<td valign="top">I currently work in the building that this piece used to be in front of. People often call and inquire about what happened to it. Here are some other pics of this sculpture that I have found:<br/> <br/><a href="//otherworld.celtic-twilight.com/mysticalrealm/dragons/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//otherworld.celtic-twilight.com/mysticalrealm/dragons/</a></td>', 'I currently work in the building that this piece used to be in front of. People often call and inquire about what happened to it. Here are some other pics of this sculpture that I have found: //otherworld.celtic-twilight.com/mysticalrealm/dragons/', '2005-09-06 19:50:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1693067, 121247, 43983, '<td valign="top">Lovely Car, nice shot! Sir William died in 1985 and was last involved with the Xj-S design project. I''ve enjoyed Jaguars as daily transport for 35 years starting with the E-type.<br/> <br/>You would have benefited from cropping beyond the wings and to the ground. If your reg. plate was showing you should remove it and replace it with a Leaper plate or Ujack flag plate.<br/> <br/>Robert<br/>Jaguar Magazine, Photojournalist</td>', 'Lovely Car, nice shot! Sir William died in 1985 and was last involved with the Xj-S design project. I''ve enjoyed Jaguars as daily transport for 35 years starting with the E-type. You would have benefited from cropping beyond the wings and to the ground. If your reg. plate was showing you should remove it and replace it with a Leaper plate or Ujack flag plate. RobertJaguar Magazine, Photojournalist', '2005-09-10 14:54:44.000000', NULL, 0),
