(5672603, 120710, 67145, '<td valign="top">its a beautiful shot peggy .. <br/>i read your story in the thread ... its often nearly impossible to understand why some ppl behave as they do .. the child for starters and then his parents .. no intervention is unbelievable .. very upsetting for anyone who loves animals to witness.. upsetting just to hear about it .. :)</td>', 'its a beautiful shot peggy .. i read your story in the thread ... its often nearly impossible to understand why some ppl behave as they do .. the child for starters and then his parents .. no intervention is unbelievable .. very upsetting for anyone who loves animals to witness.. upsetting just to hear about it .. :)', '2009-10-03 06:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
