(5672893, 120710, 90414, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, he looks so tough with the studded collar!<br/>That is a sad story you included in the thread. Those are the type of parents who hold everybody else accountable for their children''s behavior, then wonder "why" when the kid someday ends up in prison. Very sad.</td>', 'Excellent image, he looks so tough with the studded collar!That is a sad story you included in the thread. Those are the type of parents who hold everybody else accountable for their children''s behavior, then wonder "why" when the kid someday ends up in prison. Very sad.', '2009-10-03 11:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
